    继续探索
  </h3>
  
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
    <a href="/pricing" class="group bg-[#131F33] hover:bg-white/5 border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/30 rounded-xl p-4 transition-all flex flex-col">
      <span class="text-white font-medium mb-1 group-hover:text-breeze-cyan transition-colors">查看微风网络套餐 &rarr;</span>
